<section id="privacy">
	<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
	<p>
		Do Later is committed to protecting your privacy. We do not collect, store, or transmit any personal
		information. All data - including your tasks, task generators, and completion status - is stored locally on
		your device and never leaves the app.
	</p>
</section>

<section>
	<h2>Data Storage</h2>
	<p>
		All information is saved in on-device storage on your iPhone. We do not synchronize or back up your data to any
		external servers unless you choose to do so via iCloud or other device-managed backups.
	</p>
</section>

<section>
	<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
	<p>
		Do Later does not integrate any third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking services. The app functions
		entirely offline, ensuring no external data collection or network dependency.
	</p>
</section>

